{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27913","headline":"和刘补阙秋园寓兴之什十首 三 · 朱庆余","name":"和刘补阙秋园寓兴之什十首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逍遥人事外，杖屦入杉萝。\n草色寒犹在，虫声晚渐多。\n静逢山鸟下，幽称野僧过。\n几许新开菊，闲从落叶和。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}